    "body": "I also had issues with this command via Powershell. See https://github.com/starship/starship/discussions/2534 and https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/2624.\r\n\r\nMy current solution for this is _not_ to use Powershell 😁:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[custom.git_email]\r\ncommand = 'git config user.email'\r\nwhen = 'git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree 2> /dev/null'\r\nshell = ['C:\\Program Files\\Git\\bin\\sh.exe']\r\nformat = 'by [${output} ]($style)'\r\nstyle = 'bright-yellow'\r\ndisabled = false\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe output is still printed inside Powershell but the command itself is being run via Git Bash for Windows.",
