    "body": "This issue has defeated me. I'm trying out starship and I have a fully working configuration with a custom command that works perfectly under Ubuntu (in WSL). The identical configuration with the custom command replaced by a PowerShell equivalent either always or never shows the output. The same happens if I use the original command setting the shell to git bash as suggested, or if I make the PowerShell command call git bash. All of these can produce the correct `starship prompt`, and then proceed to show the wrong thing again instead.\r\n\r\nWould appreciate any additional insights on things I could still try.",
